    "One-time purchase through the App Store. Points are added to your account right away, with no recurring subscription." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 App Store 一次性购买。积分会立即添加到你的账户，不会自动续订。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過 App Store 一次性購買。點數會立即加入你的帳號，不會自動續訂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a hash of each key is stored, so a key can’t be shown again. Revoke a key you lost and create a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个密钥只保存其哈希值，因此无法再次显示。如果遗失了密钥，请撤销它并创建新的密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個金鑰只儲存其雜湊值，因此無法再次顯示。如果遺失了金鑰，請撤銷它並建立新的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Onward" : {
      "comment" : "Trip route kind: travelling on to a new place",
